        "descriptions": [
            {
                "value": "A high quality genome sequence of Theobroma cacao is presented together with predicted polypeptide sequences and a functional annoation. The genome sequence was assembled based on ONT long reads using NextDenvo. BRAKER3 was used for the annotation of protein encoding genes.",
